	(text
		"DESIGN NOTES\nL76K: GPS + BeiDou + GLONASS + QZSS, L1 only (no NavIC: Lite is not for AIS-140).\nU6 LDO switched by modem GPIO3 (GNSS_EN): GNSS fully off when parked. V_BCKP = VCC.\nUART 1.8 V <-> 3.3 V through Q3/Q4 BSS138 shifters (modem MAIN UART = NMEA port).\nActive patch bias from VCC_RF via R16/L2; DNP R16 + L2 for a passive patch. RF_IN direct to the U.FL."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 72.39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "39899eb7-c624-5eee-b519-ee1e6a090438")
	)
	(text
		"PART NOTES (VERIFY = check against vendor datasheet before release)\nU5: V_BCKP tied to VCC: hot start only while GNSS_EN is high (AGNSS on cold start) - VERIFY pins vs L76K HD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 219.71 72.39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1b7dbe57-90e4-5e72-be6f-d08c9a143d60")
	)
